    "object": {
      "Graph": {
        "@Type": "f8a58466",
        "@Value": {
          "Implementation": {
            "@Type": "3b83b776",
            "@Value": {
              "TextDocument": {
                "@Type": "f3878285",
                "@Value": {
                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)FOR tail := 1 TO CONS_HEAP_SIZE DO\n\tput(tail);\nEND_FOR\n\nFB_Init := TRUE;\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)39c02b43-a907-4504-a1e8-b9de11d89ba0_Impl_LineIds"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "Interface": {
            "@Type": "a9ed5b7e",
            "@Value": {
              "TextDocument": {
                "@Type": "f3878285",
                "@Value": {
                  "TextBlobForSerialisation": "(string)(*\n================================================================================\nFunction Block Method : ConsHeap.FB_Init\n\nPurpose:\n    Adds every heap register to the free list during function block\n    initialisation.\n\nApplication:\n    Called automatically by CODESYS when the function block instance is\n    initialised.\n\nOperation:\n    1. Iterates over registers 1 through CONS_HEAP_SIZE.\n    2. Calls put for each register.\n\nInputs:\n    bInitRetains - CODESYS retained-data initialisation flag.\n    bInCopyCode - CODESYS copy-code flag.\n\nOutputs:\n    None.\n\nInOut:\n    None.\n\nReturn Value:\n    BOOL - CODESYS FB_Init result; this implementation does not explicitly\n    assign a value.\n\nAssumptions:\n    - The heap bounds correspond to 1..CONS_HEAP_SIZE.\n\nLimitations:\n    - The input flags are not used by this implementation.\n\nDependencies:\n    - ConsHeap.put.\n    - CONS_HEAP_SIZE.\n\nExample:\n\n    Called by the CODESYS runtime; do not normally call it directly.\n\nRevision History:\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    Date         Version  Author           Description\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n    13/11/2026   1.0      CannyIEC         Documented existing behaviour\n    ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n\nSPDX-License-Identifier: MIT\n================================================================================\n*)\nMETHOD FB_Init : BOOL\nVAR_INPUT\n\tbInitRetains : BOOL;\n\tbInCopyCode  : BOOL;\nEND_VAR\nVAR\n\ttail : CONS_REG;\nEND_VAR\n",
                  "LineInfoPersistence": "(string)39c02b43-a907-4504-a1e8-b9de11d89ba0_Decl_LineIds"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "TypeInfos": {
        "3b83b776": "{3b83b776-fb25-43b8-99f2-3c507c9143fc}",
